{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "SingleR classic 模式要求参考矩阵行名为基因名、列为已知标签的参考样本。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "@param ref A numeric matrix of expression values where rows are genes and columns are reference samples (individual cells or bulk samples)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "测试与参考必须有非空基因交集；若交集为空（例如基因注释命名空间不同），会报错。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "The function will automatically restrict the analysis to the intersection of the genes in both \\code{ref} and \\code{test}.\n#' If this intersection is empty (e.g., because the two datasets use different gene annotations), an error will be raised."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的参考基因命名空间是 HGNC symbols，而测试基因命名空间是 Ensembl stable IDs，两者不同，因此不能直接开始，需先确认交集是否非空。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:reference_gene_namespace",
        "user:test_gene_namespace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的参考 assay 是 log-normalized expression，测试 assay 是 UMI counts；经典模式对测试表达尺度没有硬性要求，但参考与测试的基因对应关系仍需先验证。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:reference_assay",
        "user:test_assay"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：原始 UMI counts 或转录本 counts 被明确允许用于相关性计算，log 变换并非必需；但这不代表可以忽略基因交集检查。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "In practice, the raw counts (for UMI data) or the transcript counts (for read count data) can also be used without normalization and log-transformation."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：参考数据的具体 artifact 字节与不可变修订尚未获取，不能仅凭论文引用或通用输入矩阵替代参考 artifact；这属于可检测性局限，不代表当前输入已满足要求。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "The method uses annotated reference expression data, but actual reference artifact bytes and immutable revisions have not been acquired."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "请提供测试与参考基因交集是否非空，或提供用于映射 HGNC symbols 与 Ensembl stable IDs 的映射表/已转换的基因名。",
    "missing_field": "gene_intersection_status",
    "why_needed": "因为参考使用 HGNC symbols 而测试使用 Ensembl stable IDs，若交集为空会直接报错；只有确认交集非空或提供映射表后才能判断是否可以开始。"
  }
}
